.env
# Generated / large binaries kept local (not versioned)
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Video pipeline scratch (intermediate ffmpeg segments, extracted frames,
# QA crops) — never committed, regenerated by each project's build.py,
# see videos/FOODEATUP-TUTORIELS-WORKFLOW.md
videos/*/work/
videos/stories-foodeatup-30j/assets/avatar/mika.mp4
videos/stories-foodeatup-30j/preview/
# Working-tree copies of other feature branches' projects (owned by their own branches)
videos/foodeatup-tutoriel-5min/
videos/rapidorh-presentation-4min/
videos/rapidocms-presentation-4min/assets/avatar/
# Per-project scratch (frames, segments, silent renders)
videos/**/work/
# Dossiers de travail des rendus HyperFrames : intermédiaires volumineux,
# recréés à chaque rendu. La règle est ici plutôt que dans un .gitignore par
# film — sur sept films, en oublier un suffit à commiter des milliers de PNG.
videos/**/out/work-*/
videos/**/out/*hf-transaction*/
videos/**/out/qa/
